+# Coding Agent Refactoring - Implementation Notes
+
+## Objective
+Refactor `AgenticSystem.forward()` into a bounded multi-attempt pipeline that:
+1. Creates a shared test harness (build_tests phase)
+2. Runs K=3 independent solve attempts with different strategies
+3. Evaluates all candidates using a new scoring tool
+4. Reflects and improves based on failing inputs (up to N rounds)
+5. Finalizes by copying the best solution and cleaning up scratch files
+
+## Key Requirements
+
+### Tool Schema Correctness
+- `required` must be at the same level as `properties` (NOT nested inside properties)
+- Every property must have both `type` and `description`
+- Solution paths should use `{type: array, items: {type: string}}` with NO minItems/maxItems
+
+### Generator Interface
+- `python3 gen.py <seed> <mode>` format
+- Modes: `tiny`, `random`, `edge`, `max`
+- Seed parameter for reproducibility
+
+### Checker Interface
+- `python3 checker.py <input_file> <expected_file> <actual_file>`
+- Exit code 0 = accepted, non-zero = rejected
+
+### Evaluation Report
+Must include:
+- Sample pass/fail per candidate
+- Per-mode pass counts
+- First failing input (saved to disk) with expected/actual output and timing
+- Max-input runtime
+- TLE/RE counted as failures
+- Pairwise disagreement counts between candidates
+- Ranking score
+- `BEST: <path>` line
+- `ALL_PASS: yes/no` line
+
+### Helper Methods for forward()
+- `build_tests()` - Create shared harness (brute.py, gen.py, samples/, optional checker.py)
+- `solve_attempt(i, hint, feedback)` - Run i-th attempt with hint and feedback
+- `evaluate_candidates_report()` - Call evaluate_candidates tool
+- `reflect_round(r, report)` - Improve best candidate based on feedback
+- `finalize()` - Copy best solution, remove scratch files, verify samples
+
+### Bounded Iteration
+- Use only `for i in range(K)` and `for r in range(MAX_ROUNDS)` loops
+- NO `while True` loops
+- Parse only `ALL_PASS` and `BEST:` lines from evaluation report
+- Pass raw report to agent for later rounds
+
+## Implementation Steps
+
+1. ✅ Create `tools/evaluate_candidates.py` with proper schema
+2. ✅ Update `tools/__init__.py` to export the tool  
+3. ✅ Create helper methods in `coding_agent.py`
+4. ✅ Update `forward()` to use the new pipeline
+5. ✅ Test schema validation
+
+## Previous Attempts Failures (if any)
+None recorded yet - this is the first Round 2 attempt.
