+
+### Step 4: Refactor forward() Method
+
+Replace the current phased approach with the bounded multi-attempt pipeline:
+
+```python
+def forward(self):
+    max_rounds = 5
+    
+    for round_num in range(1, max_rounds + 1):
+        if round_num == 1:
+            # Round 1: Full constraint-aware workflow + multi-attempts
+            # 1. Build tests
+            # 2. Run 3 solve attempts in parallel (via LLM)
+            # 3. Evaluate all candidates
+            # 4. Check if all pass → done
+        else:
+            # Rounds 2-5: Focused improvement
+            # 1. Analyze previous failures
+            # 2. Reflect and improve best candidate
+            # 3. Re-evaluate
+            # 4. Check if all pass → done
+        
+        if all_pass:
+            finalize()
+            break
+```
+
+## Bounded Iteration Rules
+
+### DO:
+- ✅ Use `for round_num in range(1, MAX_ROUNDS + 1)`
+- ✅ Use `for attempt_num in range(1, K + 1)`
+- ✅ Parse report for `ALL_PASS: yes` to detect success
+- ✅ Break early when success detected
+- ✅ Have clear exit after max rounds
+
+### DON'T:
+- ❌ No `while True` loops (unbounded)
+- ❌ No recursive agent calls
+- ❌ No dynamic round allocation
+- ❌ No "keep trying forever" logic
+
+## Tool Integration
+
+### verify_solution Tool (Already Exists)
+Used in Round 3 for quick feedback:
+```python
