+    solution_path='solution.py',
+    samples_dir='.',
+    brute_path='brute.py',
+    generator_path='gen.py',
+    max_input_path='max_input.txt'
+)
+```
+
+### evaluate_candidates Tool (NEW)
+Used in Round 1 to compare multiple solutions:
+```python
