+1. ✅ Create `tools/evaluate_candidates.py`
+2. ✅ Update `tools/__init__.py`
+3. ✅ Add helper methods to `coding_agent.py`
+4. ✅ Refactor `forward()` method
+5. ⏳ Test with actual problem (when assigned)
+6. ⏳ Run samples, stress_test, verify_solution
+7. ⏳ Debug and fix any failures
+8. ⏳ Finalize solution
